lture from a cloned viral genome</article-title><source>Nat Med</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>791</fpage><lpage>796</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15951748</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat-0030103-b017"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhong</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gastaminza</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kapadia</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kato</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Robust hepatitis C virus infection in vitro</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>102</volume><fpage>9294</fpage><lpage>9299</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15939869</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat-0030103-b018"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Villanueva</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wakita</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Lemon</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Production of infectious genotype 1a hepatitis C virus (Hutchinson strain) in cultured human hepatoma cells</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>103</volume><fpage>2310</fpage><lpage>2315</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16461899</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ppat-0030103-b019"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pietschmann</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaul</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Koutsoudakis</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Shavinskaya</su